Subject: [PATCH 3/5] drm_syncobj subset

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/drm_syncobj.c | 154 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/drm_syncobj.h |  79 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 233 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/drm_syncobj.c
